          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze aca ahindukiriza amaso ku ruhome, asenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avuga ati: “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " we, ibuka ingene nagendeye imbere yawe mu bwizigirwa nkagukorera nguhaye umutima wanje wose, ngakora ivyo ubona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga zawe.” Hezekiya ararira cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko imbere y’uko Yesaya arengana mu rugo ataha, ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rimuzako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti: “Subira inyuma ubwire Hezekiya, umutware w’ubwoko bwanje uti, uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana ya sogokuruza Dawidi avuze: ‘Numvise ugusenga kwawe, kandi nabonye amarira yawe, none ngiye kugukiza. Inyuma y’imisi itatu uzoduga mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzokwongera iyindi myaka cumi n’itanu yo kubaho. Kandi wewe n’iki gisagara nzobakiza amaboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri. Nzogwanira iki gisagara ku bw’izina ryanje no ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
