        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Hezekiya, ivyo yashitseko, ingene yubatse ikidengeri, n’ingene yubatse umugende uca mu kuzimu uzana amazi mu gisagara, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? ",
          "type": "text",
